[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9901.83, "timestamp": "02:45:01", "text": "持っている。 H はヴァレラントをやりたいです、もしよろしければ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9904.229, "timestamp": "02:45:04", "text": "または、このまま続けたい。何が"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9906.79, "timestamp": "02:45:06", "text": "私たちはヴァレラントを作ることができます。はい、できます。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9909.75, "timestamp": "02:45:09", "text": "ヴァレラント。わーい。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9910.83, "timestamp": "02:45:10", "text": "私たちは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9917.349, "timestamp": "02:45:17", "text": "マックが素敵な人だったことを願いますが、それは少し難しいですね。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9918.87, "timestamp": "02:45:18", "text": "自分が何をしているのかを理解し、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9921.349, "timestamp": "02:45:21", "text": "すべて。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9923.269, "timestamp": "02:45:23", "text": "うん。ゲームが好きなら"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9926.63, "timestamp": "02:45:26", "text": "実際に始める前に知識を身につける"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 9927.151, "timestamp": "02:45:27", "author": "@natsukisouta", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/DoWHfl2un-x9C1FjOZkls_H2TTeAipp9__JetXpYAJhuduFn6-Pn9_VXt5jORITV_b2weavr=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "ELLO"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9929.269, "timestamp": "02:45:29", "text": "勝利。真実。それまでは、あなただけです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9933.349, "timestamp": "02:45:33", "text": "2秒に1回くらい殺される。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9942.63, "timestamp": "02:45:42", "text": "ああ、アップデートがある。ああ、いや、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9945.51, "timestamp": "02:45:45", "text": "大丈夫。私のインターネットは速いので、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9948.07, "timestamp": "02:45:48", "text": "アップデートも持っていますか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9951.309, "timestamp": "02:45:51", "text": "そうねぇ。開けています"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9954.11, "timestamp": "02:45:54", "text": "上。"}]